1. 6 Jan 1760, bt, Sandvig, Jens Hansen s.o. Hans Jensen, Anna Jørgen Jørgensens i Magaarden bar det - test. Capitain Jens Larsen - Niels Michelsen - Kirstine Jørgensdatter - Karen Hans Samuels
2. 20 Jan 1760, bt, Sandvig, Elisabeth Jensdatter d.o. Jens Jørgensen, Giesa Capt. Jens Larsens bar det - test. Christian Jørgensen - Niels Michelsen Thorn - Malena Nielsdatter - Kirstina Rasmus Thomassens
3. 27 Jan 1760, bt, Sandvig, Michel Andersen s.o. Anders Ipsen skomager, Else Dorthea West Jensens bar det - test. Niels Michelsen - Eske Jacobsen - Kirstine Hansdatter - Margrethe Peder Larsens
4. 17 Feb 1760, bt, Løsbæk, Jørgen Christiansen s.o. Christian Jørgensen, Giesa Capt. Jens Larsens bar det - test. Hans Hillebrandt - Jørgen Andersen - Englika Nielsdatter - Karen Jørgen Samuels
5. 21 Feb 1760, bt, Sandvig, Peder Madsen s.o. Mads Pedersen, Kirstine Hans Jespersens bar det - test. Peder Hillebrandt - Helje Hansen - Maria Hansdatter - Else Helje Hansens
6. 21 Feb 1760, bt, Sandvig, Karen Pedersdatter d.o. Peder Pedersen, Kirstina Gierth Hansens bar det - test. Peder Jensen - Jens Hillebrandt - Sejne Hansdatter - Elsebye Jens Friderichsens
7. 12 Mar 1760, bt, Slotsvangen, Haagen Boesen s.o. Boe Haagensen, Else Dorthea West Jens bar det - test. Peder Haagensen - Jørgen Westesen - Elisabeth Hansdatter - Kirstina Niels Haagensens
8. 19 Mar 1760, bt, Allinge-Sandvig sogn, Mogens Nielsen s.o. Niels Andersen Skræder, Karen Jørgen Samuels bar det - test. Johan Hansen - Jørgen Andersen - Malena Nielsdatter - Kirstina Rasmusdatter
9. 30 Mar 1760, bt, Sandvig, Anna Marie Clemensdatter d.o. Clemen Christian, Bodil Michel Grønbæks bar det - test. Hans Hermansen - Erich Pedersen Røstrøm - Else Cathrina Christiansdatter - Johanne Hans Botkers
10. 20 Apr 1760, bt, Sandvig, Ellen Olesdatter d.o. Ole Mogensen, Kirstina Rasmus Peders af Rutsker Sogn bar det - test. Jens Aagesen - Erich Røstrøm - Kirstina Mogensdatter - Ellen Lars Larsens
11. 4 May 1760, bt, Allinge-Sandvig sogn, Mette Sophia Hansdatter d.o. Hans Bendtsen, Dorthea Anders Müllers bar det - test. Hans Samuelsen - Jacob Madsen - Margrethe Pedersdatter - Anna Cathrina Claus Olsens
